{"id": "EUVD-2026-60592", "enisaUuid": "80918a8b-35fc-3b80-9475-a8fe931b0f2b", "description": "Grav before 2.0.15 contains a stored cross-site scripting vulnerability in the detectXss() function where unpaired quotes in unquoted attribute values bypass event-handler detection. Authenticated editors can inject event handlers like onerror= that pass validation and execute in visitor browsers when page content is rendered.", "datePublished": "2026-08-18T11:19:41", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-08T15:24:56", "baseScore": 9.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:P/VC:H/VI:H/VA:N/SC:H/SI:H/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/getgrav/grav/security/advisories/GHSA-vfmf-q6x9-cw96", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/grav-before-stored-xss-via-detectxss-quote-bypass"], "aliases": ["GHSA-9pr6-8r9w-wvmj", "GHSA-vfmf-q6x9-cw96", "CVE-2026-75828"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.39, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "9a524ba9-a46e-3030-8d56-2e20153d4fc3", "product": {"name": "grav", "vendor": {"name": "getgrav"}}, "product_version": "0 <2.0.15"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "5a366519-4cfe-38a6-92ee-e3f479ac4421", "vendor": {"name": "getgrav"}}], "isExploited": false}